      "3": "Bald crown with sparse brown side/rear hair, separate brown brows and full brown moustache preserve source. Olive-grey broad-lapel uniform, paired red/gold leaf collar tabs, cream pointed shirt and dark green tie, screen-right three-quarter gaze/serious expression/crop/light and full pale painted backing match. Smooth yellow noseless/earless green-eyed face, small single dark parting beneath moustache and short broad collar transition without long stalk/pinching/floating cloth/white bib. Tiny leaf engraving/tie weave/individual sparse hairs unresolved, not claimed exact. All raw/mattes solid255, no visible holes/backing loss."
