      "4": "Full unchanged raw has clear red/peach realistic human lips with Cupid-bow upper lip and fleshy highlighted lower lip below the moustache; convert to one simple mascot mouth while retaining serious expression and facial hair. Preserve brown swept side-parted hair/separate brows/short beard, dark navy suit/white pointed shirt/red tie, screen-right three-quarter pose/crop/light/full dark-grey vignette. Broad short neck/collar otherwise sound without stalk/floating cloth/white bib; tiny hair/tie weave unresolved. Raw and complete matte views solid255, no visible holes/backing loss. Actual failure is human lip anatomy."
